// The Lantern Ward end to end from `player_start` (0, 14), along its `tour` spline: a leg a point of it, each
// aimed from where the last one ended, so none presses into a wall. Then the return to `court`, checkpoint 0,
// the first of its checkpoints by their names' hashes.
// Legs fitted to the ground by running them, so a change to the controller or a collider can leave a leg
// pressing into something it used to clear: the replays' checksums say so, and `tests/walks.rs` says where
// each walk has to get to.
